{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36895","headline":"吴门晚泊寄句曲道友 · 罗隐","name":"吴门晚泊寄句曲道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"采香径在人不留，采香径下停叶舟。\n桃花李花鬬红白，山鸟水鸟自献酬。\n十万梅鋗空寸土，三分孙策竟荒丘。\n未知到了关身否，笑杀雷平许远游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36895.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36895","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}